comments[3]:
  - created_at: "2026-10-20T20:40:15.393Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Duplicate check: full all-status corpus and live searches for assurance missing Sentry, operational refusal, and assurance declaration not found found the closed pm-9yhl2v gate-selection predecessor but no declaration-read owner. Full predecessor metadata, history/comment evidence and release resolution were read. Current open/in-progress inventories distinguish this new Sentry group from completed gate-trigger work. https://unbrained.sentry.io/issues/154999406/"
    edited_at: "2026-10-20T20:43:56.191Z"
  - created_at: "2026-10-20T20:44:05.662Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: Seven new direct SDK and SDK/MCP action regression cases failed against the original declaration-read behavior; all 29 focused cases now pass. getAssuranceDeclaration uses the existing AssuranceEvaluationRefusalError subtype and both show and promote normalize only this expected read refusal. Existing unexpected-TypeError preservation tests remain green. The live parent was fully verified after intake; no parent claim or reopening of the shipped predecessor is required. Fresh host/packed CLI and Sentry retirement still require the reviewed build.
  - created_at: "2026-10-20T20:49:22.925Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Built public SDK and CLI acceptance: Node and Bun each return exit 2 / invalid_argument_value for missing measurement, assertion and gate reads in isolated trackers. Both runtimes import the published governance entrypoint from the built package and preserve AssuranceEvaluationRefusalError plus TypeError identity for all three kinds. Linked 29-case SDK/action/MCP suite, targeted ESLint and no-emit TypeScript checks pass. The original Sentry group is retained until the reviewed fix lands and a fresh live probe proves no recurrence."
